            <ArticleTitle>[Ontogenetic stress-reactivity in lungs: lipid metabolism].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>456-62</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The changes of surface activity, lipid components and lipid peroxidation were found in lung tissue under conditions of emotional-pain stress in rats. Study of stress-sensitivity of lung tissue showed different direction and manifestation of metabolic changes of lipid metabolism in young and adult rats.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
